# Domain Vocabulary

Use consistent, spec-defined terminology throughout code, comments, docs, and commit
messages. Sources: `docs/feature-list.md`, `docs/spec.md`, `docs/api-contract.md`,
`docs/config-spec.md`.

[Corpus: product] [Corpus: system-spec] [Corpus: config]

## Critical Distinctions (ChatRAG)

| Correct | Incorrect / avoid | Why |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **corpus** (documents → chunks → embeddings) | “index” alone; “knowledge base” without corpus | Product noun in feature-list / schema |
| **chunk** | passage / snippet (as the stored unit) | Stored retrieval unit; tags attach to chunks |
| **document** / `document_id` | `doc_id` alone | Schema + F75 idempotent key uses `document_id` |
| **retrieval** / **pgvector** | “search” alone when meaning RAG recall | F5 / F22 tag-aware retrieval |
| **embed** / **embedding** | “vectorize” as the only verb | Modal FastEmbed path (F10) |
| **tag** / **retag** | label / category alone | F20 LLM auto-tag + admin retag |
| **ChatRAG** | “chatbot” as the deployable name | Public ask surface vs Data Management admin |
| **Data Management** (admin) | “CMS” / “dashboard app” alone | Admin ingest/browse/jobs/eval surface |
| **`vecinita-llm`** (prod) | Ollama / `vecinita-ollama` | ADR-037; Ollama is not the live prod path |
| **`vecinita-llm-playground`** | prod URL for list/pull | Separate playground app (TP-S010-27) |
| **human promote** (LoRA) | auto-promote / metric abort as gate | F77 / ADR-053 |

## Corpus automations + FT (F75–F77)

| Correct | Incorrect / avoid | Why |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **catch-up** (failed/partial/missing embed) | re-embed everything; “full reindex on change” | F75 is residual catch-up only (RD-334) |
| `job_type=automation_catchup` | generic “automation” without type | Distinct from freshness (RD-336) |
| `job_type=freshness_refresh` | “re-crawl job” as sole name | API/job_type contract (EV-027) |
| **stale** (default **30 days**) | “expired”, arbitrary default | RD-337 / `VECINITA_FRESHNESS_STALE_DAYS` |
| `document_id` + `revision` (idempotent key) | `doc_id` alone | RD-335 / ADR-052 |
| **LoRA** / **PEFT** adapter | full fine-tune (as default) | F77 / ADR-053 |
| **SFT** (instruction/QA pairs from chunks) | CPT-only / “just train on text” | RD-340 |
| **human promote** (eval evidence) | “eval-gated” as automated abort | RD-338 / RD-346 |
| prod **`vecinita-llm`** after promote | auto-load latest adapter | RD-339 |

## Parameter Names

Use exact parameter / env names from `docs/config-spec.md`:

| Concern | Correct | Do not use |
|---------|---------|------------|
| Retrieval depth | `VECINITA_TOP_K` / `top_k` | `k`, `n_results`, `limit` alone |
| Min similarity gate | `VECINITA_MIN_RETRIEVAL_SCORE` | inventing score floors |
| Chunk size / overlap | documented ingest options (`chunk_size_tokens`, overlap) | arbitrary token sizes without spec |
| Freshness stale days | `VECINITA_FRESHNESS_STALE_DAYS` | `stale_days` alone as env |
| Automations master | `VECINITA_AUTOMATIONS_ENABLED` | silent always-on |
| Kill-switch | `VECINITA_AUTOMATIONS_KILL_SWITCH` | bypassing for F75 enqueue / F77 train |
| FT adapter pin | `VECINITA_FINETUNE_ADAPTER_ID` | silent latest-on-disk |
| Playground adapter | `VECINITA_PLAYGROUND_FINETUNE_ADAPTER_ID` | loading candidates on prod |
| FT concurrency cap | `VECINITA_FINETUNE_MAX_CONCURRENT` | shared automations max alone for FT |
| FT daily run cap | `VECINITA_FINETUNE_MAX_RUNS_PER_DAY` | GPU-hour metering (deferred) |
| Prod LLM URL | `VECINITA_MODAL_LLM_URL` | playground URL for ChatRAG |
| Proxy auth | `VECINITA_MODAL_PROXY_KEY` | omitting on generate/warm/models |

## Quality / eval language

| Term | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| **golden set** | Fixed eval questions in `docs/eval-golden-set.md` (F36; F77 promote evidence) |
| **sources[]** | Cited retrieval hits returned with an answer |
| **packed context** | Post-packer LLM context (`VECINITA_RAG_PACKER`, char budget) |
| **promote evidence** | Base vs adapter eval comparison for human F77 promote — not auto-abort |

## Out of product vocabulary

Do **not** treat antibody Job-template terms as Vecinita product vocabulary
(`RFdiffusion`, `ProteinMPNN`, `RF2`/`pAE`/`pBind`, `diffuser_T`, `mpnn_*`, Quiver,
`cognichem-rfantibody`). Those are leftover overlay — not ChatRAG features. If they
appear in historical docs, do not extend them into new code or commits.

## When in Doubt

Check `docs/feature-list.md`, `docs/api-contract.md`, and `docs/config-spec.md` first.
If still ambiguous, raise `[Ambiguity]` with the candidate terms and a recommendation.
